<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>In the second looped construction in spell_chainlightning <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/User%20-%20Georg%20Zoeller" title="User:Georg Zoeller (page does not exist)">Georg Zoeller</a>'s comments refer to as the <code>SPELL_SECONDARY_IMPACT</code> and in talent_scattershot he terms it as <code>/*the bad event*/</code>.
</p><p>90210 is an easy to remember number as it (famously) the zip code for Beverly Hills which may be why it was selected as the literal value for and event type which would never be given a symbolic constant.
</p>
